**Effective Date: September 24, 2026**
**Last Updated: September 24, 2026**

YURI NO1 (referred to below as “YURI NO1,” “we,” “us,” or “the Website”) respects the privacy and protection of users’ personal information.

This Privacy Policy explains how we may collect, use, retain, and process information when you use the official YURI NO1 website (referred to below as “the Website”).

By using the Website, you acknowledge that you have read and understood this Privacy Policy.

**1. Scope**

This Privacy Policy applies to the content and services directly provided by the Website.

The Website may contain links to third-party websites, social media platforms, video platforms, or other external services. Once you access a third-party service, the collection and processing of information will be governed by that third party’s privacy policy and applicable rules.

This Privacy Policy does not apply to third-party websites or services that are outside the control of YURI NO1.

**2. Information We May Collect**

Depending on how you use the Website, we may have access to the following types of information:

**Information You Voluntarily Provide**

This may include:

* Your name or display name provided when contacting us;
* Your email address;
* Messages or other information you voluntarily submit;
* Fan creations or other submissions;
* Other information you voluntarily provide to the Website.

Unless voluntarily provided by the user, the Website generally does not require users to provide unnecessary personal information.

**Information Generated When You Use the Website**

The Website and the services it uses may automatically generate or collect certain technical information, such as:

* IP address;
* Browser type;
* Device or operating system information;
* Website browsing and usage records;
* Access time;
* Referring page;
* Information generated through cookies or similar technologies.

Such information may be automatically processed by the website platform, hosting provider, analytics tools, or other third-party services used by the Website.

**3. How We Use Information**

We may use collected information for the following purposes:

* Providing, maintaining, and improving the Website;
* Responding to user inquiries;
* Processing submissions or content voluntarily provided by users;
* Maintaining website security and preventing abuse;
* Analyzing website usage;
* Improving website content and user experience;
* Sending notifications or information requested by users;
* Complying with legal obligations;
* Handling other matters necessary for the normal operation of the Website.

We will not use personal information provided by users for purposes unrelated to the purpose for which it was collected, unless we have obtained the user’s consent or applicable law otherwise permits or requires such use.

**4. Cookies and Similar Technologies**

The Website and the third-party services it uses may use cookies or similar technologies to:

* Keep the Website functioning properly;
* Remember certain user preferences;
* Analyze website traffic and usage;
* Improve website functionality and user experience.

Users may manage, restrict, or delete cookies through their browser settings.

However, disabling certain cookies may cause some features of the Website to function improperly.

**5. Third-Party Services**

The Website may use websites, analytics services, video services, social media platforms, embedded content, or other services provided by third parties.

Such services may collect and process technical data or other information in accordance with their own policies.

For example, the Website may link to or embed videos, social media content, or other external content provided by third parties.

YURI NO1 does not have complete control over the data processing practices of third-party services. Users should review the applicable privacy policies of those third parties separately.

**6. Data Retention**

We retain information only for as long as reasonably necessary to provide services, handle related matters, comply with legal obligations, or resolve disputes.

The retention period may vary depending on the type of information, the purpose for which it is used, and applicable laws.

When information is no longer necessary to retain, we will, within reasonable limits, delete, anonymize, or cease using such information.

**7. Disclosure and Provision of Information**

Except in the following circumstances, YURI NO1 will not arbitrarily sell or rent users’ personal information:

* With the user’s consent;
* When necessary to provide the Website or related services;
* When third-party service providers are engaged to assist with website operations;
* When required to comply with applicable laws, judicial proceedings, or lawful requests from government authorities;
* When necessary to protect the rights, safety, or legitimate interests of YURI NO1, users, or third parties;
* In other circumstances where disclosure or provision is permitted by law.

If third-party services participate in the operation of the Website, their processing of information may also be governed by their own policies.

**8. Data Security**

YURI NO1 will take reasonable and practicable measures to protect personal information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, loss, or other improper use.

However, no method of internet transmission or electronic storage can be guaranteed to be completely secure. Accordingly, YURI NO1 cannot guarantee that information transmitted or stored online will be completely free from unexpected risks.

**9. User Rights**

Depending on applicable laws, users may have the following rights regarding their personal information:

* The right to request access to or review their personal information;
* The right to request copies of their personal information;
* The right to request supplementation or correction;
* The right to request that the collection, processing, or use of their personal information be stopped;
* The right to request deletion;
* Other rights provided by applicable law.

If you wish to exercise any of these rights, please contact us through the official contact information provided on the Website.

YURI NO1 may require certain information to verify the identity of the requester and prevent unauthorized requests for personal information, where permitted or required by applicable law.

**10. Minors**

Some works available on the Website may contain psychological thriller, horror, adult-themed, or other content that may not be suitable for all age groups. Even where YURI NO1 does not subjectively classify a work as NSFW, differences in individual interpretation may give rise to concerns.

Appropriate content notices may be provided where applicable.

The Website does not request personal information from minors for the purpose of collecting unnecessary personal data.

If a parent or legal guardian believes that a minor has provided personal information to the Website without appropriate consent or authorization, please contact us through the official contact information provided on the Website.

**11. Fan Submissions and Public Content**

If a user voluntarily submits fan creations, comments, contributions, or other content to YURI NO1, the user is responsible for ensuring that such content does not contain personal information that should not be made public or private information belonging to third parties.

For information regarding the rights, permissions, and official use of fan creations, please refer to:

**Fan Content Guidelines**

This Privacy Policy does not replace or supersede those guidelines.

**12. Cross-Border Data Processing**

Because the Website may use third-party websites, hosting providers, analytics tools, or other technical services located in different countries or regions, some information provided or generated by users may be processed or stored by relevant service providers in other countries or regions.

YURI NO1 will take reasonable measures to handle such information to the extent required by applicable laws.

**13. Changes to This Privacy Policy**

YURI NO1 may update this Privacy Policy due to changes in website functionality, services, applicable laws or regulations, or operating practices.

Updated versions of this Privacy Policy will be published on the Website and will indicate the date of the latest update.

Where there are material changes, YURI NO1 may notify users through a website announcement or other reasonable means, where appropriate.

**14. Contact Us**

If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy, the collection or use of personal information, or wish to exercise any rights regarding your personal information under applicable law, please contact YURI NO1 through the official contact information provided on the Website.
